feat(populi): Ed25519-signed A2A envelope, trust-ledger gate, and AuthScheme migration
scale: ~468 lines across 12 files [L]

- `crates/vox-populi/src/transport/envelope.rs`: Add `SignedA2AEnvelope` wire type for Ed25519-signed A2A control-plane messages, including canonical-input signing and self-verification logic.
- `crates/vox-populi/src/transport/auth_ed25519.rs`: Add `verify_against_trust` function to validate `SignedA2AEnvelope` against the `TrustedNodeRegistry`, enforcing clock-skew and returning a `NodeAuthContext`.
- `crates/vox-populi/src/transport/auth.rs`: Introduce `AuthScheme` enum (Ed25519Envelope/JwtHs256/Both) to control active authentication paths, with deprecation warnings for JWT-HS256 modes.
- `crates/vox-secrets/src/spec/registry/mesh.rs`: Add `VoxMeshAuthScheme` to the secret registry specification.
- `crates/vox-identity/src/trust.rs`: Extend `TrustedNodeRegistry` with `new_in_memory`, `upsert`, and `lookup_by_pubkey_hex` methods, and modify `load` to support in-memory operation.
- `crates/vox-populi/Cargo.toml`: Add `vox-identity` as an unconditional dependency.
- `crates/vox-populi/src/transport/mod.rs`: Update module imports to include new `auth_ed25519` and `envelope` modules.
- `crates/vox-populi/tests/ed25519_envelope.rs`: Add new tests for Ed25519 envelope round-trip, signature/payload tampering, and pubkey matching.
- `crates/vox-secrets/src/spec/ids.rs`: Add `VoxMeshAuthScheme` to `SecretId` enum.

